{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124205","id":4751791348,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGzqU9A","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124205","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124205.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124205.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124205","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124205/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124205/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124205/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/88b5bef51e4e58b84dd68fa62755f890d2141b58","number":124205,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Expose icon fetching interfaces from `EditorNode` in `EditorInterface`","user":{"login":"mikest","id":742517,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjUxNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/742517?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest","html_url":"https://github.com/mikest","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nThis PR is intended to make building plugin UI easier by exposing the same internal interface the Editor uses for resolving icons to plugin authors. Today, the code path for resolving GDExtension classes, Script classes, and Built-In classes to find the appropriate icon while accounting for subclassing is extremely complex.\r\n\r\nThis exposes the existing code paths in EditorNode for getting the icon by class name, as well as getting an icon for some arbitrary object.\r\n\r\nThe details and use cases for this have been written up here:\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/15574\r\n\r\n\r\n- Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/15574\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nSome things I wasn't able to resolve because I don't know what the best practices are:\r\n- Update the GDExtension interface so this functionality is available there.\r\n- Update the Docs to describe these two new methods on `EditorInterface`\r\n\r\nI did do testing with my own GDExtension, custom classes, and GDScript derived classes and all icons where returned correctly.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"483\" height=\"722\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e24dc287-fada-483b-9fbc-77e49a7088db\" />\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":307135532,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMDcxMzU1MzI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:plugin","name":"topic:plugin","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":16503691,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A-9O